  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Philippines Super Typhoon Rai/ Odette Relief Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Super Typhoon Rai, locally named Odette, caused a devastating damage in the Philippines when it struck, killing 407 people and leaving more than 1,360,203 houses damaged. This relief fund will urgently support emergency aid like food, drinking water and face masks. By providing 500 FOOD/WASH packs to the most-affected households.</narrative>
  </description>
